paint "Render turn 53, paragraph 3." 100
screenshot scrolled

# Each history page is loaded only by its manual button.
press 以前のターンを読み込む
scroll 会話の履歴 -200
paint "Render turn 49, paragraph 2." 100
screenshot paged-once
scroll 会話の履歴 -200
paint "Render turn 46, paragraph 1." 100
screenshot first-page
scroll 会話の履歴 -200
# With following stopped, these scrolls reach turn 43 at this viewport.
paint "Render turn 43, paragraph 1." 100
screenshot boundary
press 以前のターンを読み込む
scroll 会話の履歴 -200
# The second manual page (turns 30–39) joins above; this scroll exposes turn 40.
paint "Render turn 40, paragraph 1." 100
screenshot second-page
